(card "exp:G-R1-2_yingli_solo" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:G-R1-2_yingli_solo"
  :body "---\nnav: 33\ntype: experiment\nid: G-R1-2_yingli_solo\nshort_name: yingli_solo\ntitle: \"G-R1-2 — 盈立 as primary signal source\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: g\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_g__source_swap]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0096\ntrain_trade_count: 39\ntrain_win_rate: 0.6154\ntrain_sharpe: 0.6331\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0147\nval_nav_mean: 0.9994\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0068\nval_window_count: 8\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: demoted\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 1\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [source_swap]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/g, round/r1, axis/source_swap, status/demoted, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# G-R1-2 — 盈立 source swap\n\n> **TL;DR** —— 用 `data/TriggerData/盈立.csv` 取代 anchor source。**train NAV 1.01, sharpe 0.63, win 61.5%** —— 几乎不赚。比 [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]] 更差。盈立 source 在 anchor pipeline 下基本无 alpha density。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 盈立 source 可能藏 alpha，与 anchor source 独立。\n- 实测：39 trade / NAV ~1.01 / val 仅 8 window。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`team_g/scripts/round_1_runner.py`; signal source = `盈立.csv`, rest = anchor.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling stat. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0096 | 39 | 0.63 | 61.5% | -1.47% |\n| Val (8w only) | 0.9994 ± 0.007 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 1; sample 极稀.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **same_axis_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]]\n- **alt_source_companion**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-3__cross_source_consensus_strict]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_g/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (G-R1-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 盈立 source 比洛阳铲更稀, win 61% near random. **不要单独 swap**。下次见 [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]] Notes \"source-swap axis 根本约束\"。\n"
